From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alessandro Fontana <alessandro.fontana@pm.me>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 22:00:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 6/8] Add MPEG-4 Part 2 and H.263 decoders

Add c2.v4l2.mpeg4.decoder and c2.v4l2.h263.decoder for stateful V4L2
devices, enabled with ro.vendor.v4l2_codec2.decoder.supported.{mpeg4,h263}:

- MPEG-4 profiles and levels are queried from the device. H.263 has no
  V4L2 control for either: Baseline and levels 10 to 70 are assumed.
- A key frame is a VOL header or an intra VOP for MPEG-4, an intra
  picture for H.263.
- Output delay of 8, as for VP8.

Assisted-by: LLM
Change-Id: I20ec6e37439f37094360edbcb8b4f8d38707d479
